    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_01_clerk_00",
      "hash64": "4B1056ADCBA7EEED",
      "text": "¡Hola! Puedes pasearte por la sede de nuestro\\nequipo del Alto Mando todo lo que quieras.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_01_clerk_01",
      "hash64": "4B1055ADCBA7ED3A",
      "text": "¡Bienvenid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa a la Plaza Costera, sede del equipo\\nde Aroa del Alto Mando!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_01_clerk_02",
      "hash64": "4B1054ADCBA7EB87",
      "text": "Imagino que vienes a participar en calidad de\\naspirante de la Liga Arándano.\\c\\nA ver, te llamabas... [VAR 0x0100(0000)], ¿verdad?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_01_clerk_03",
      "hash64": "4B1053ADCBA7E9D4",
      "text": "Para afrontar el reto del Alto Mando deberás\\nabonar 50 PA. ¿Quieres hacer el pago ahora?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_01_clerk_04",
      "hash64": "4B1052ADCBA7E821",
      "text": "Perdona, pero no tienes suficientes PA...\\c\\nSigue completando TEA y vuelve cuando hayas\\nreunido unos cuantos puntos más.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_01_system_01",
      "hash64": "03880224B52AB2E4",
      "text": "¡Has abonado 50 PA!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_01_clerk_05",
      "hash64": "4B1051ADCBA7E66E",
      "text": "Recibido el pago y todo en regla. ¡Perfecto!\\n¡Muchas gracias por tu contribución!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_01_clerk_06",
      "hash64": "4B1050ADCBA7E4BB",
      "text": "¡Aroaaa, ven aquí un segundooo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
